        {
          "text": "Aya nceciyubunuzyo ca-Jesu Kristo ncaakapegwa kwa-Leza kuti atondezye bazike bakwe zintu zyeelede kufwambaana kuboola kuciindi ciza, nkabela wakatuma kujanza lyaangelo wakwe akuziyubunwida muzike wakwe Johane, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.1.1"
            ]
          }
