        {
          "text": "Ndime johane, ndi mwanaakwanu amweenzinyoko wamumapenzi amu bwami bwa-Jesu Kristo amulukakatilo lwakwe. Ndakali mukasuwa kategwa Patmo nkaambo kamakani aa-Leza abumboni bwa-Jesu Kristo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
